        ENTRY ^"Using This Guide" #bgbc2d9f7362c692fbaf {
            TOPICS   [ "Using This Guide" ]
            TEXT """
            When you’re updating content from SRD 5.1 to SRD 5.2.1, follow these steps: 1: Apply New Names. Check the new names here and update any renamed terms in your content accordingly. 2: Check for Rules Changes by Content Type. Consider the kind of content you’re updating, and check for changes to the kind of rules it depends on. For example, if you’re publishing subclasses, make sure they still match the structure of the classes they’re meant for. If you’re publishing monsters, apply the changes to the stat block format. 3: Update Capitalization. Many more game terms are capitalized in SRD 5.2.1 than in 5.1; update their capitalization in your content to match.
            """
        }
